          "StructuralIgnorance.memOrder",
          "StructuralIgnorance.vcBounded"
        ],
        "doc": "With the empty set in the class, a VC bound of one makes any two points of a\ncommon member comparable in the membership order: otherwise the four assembled\npatterns shatter the pair.",
